  "question": {
    "text": "A current of 2 amp when passed for 5 hour through a molten salt deposits 22.2 g of metal of atomic mass 177. The oxidation state of the metal in the metal salt is<br />\r[Report your answer by rounding it upto nearset whole number]"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3.00",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>96500</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>96500</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>22.2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>96500</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3600</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>59.5</mn></math><br />Equivalent mass <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c&nbsp;</mi><mtext>mass</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mn>59.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>177</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />So <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn></math> .<br />&nbsp;"
  }
